---

---

<section id="top" class="relative flex min-h-[100svh] items-end overflow-hidden">
  <video
    class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover"
    src="/videos/header.mp4"
    poster="/posters/header.jpg"
    autoplay
    muted
    loop
    playsinline
    aria-hidden="true"></video>

  <!-- Scrims: legibilidade do header no topo e do texto em baixo -->
  <div
    class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-40 bg-gradient-to-b from-night-950/80 to-transparent"
  >
  </div>
  <div
    class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-night-950 via-night-950/45 to-transparent"
  >
  </div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-5 pb-24 pt-40 sm:px-8 sm:pb-28">
    <p class="eyebrow reveal mb-5 !text-[0.65rem] sm:!text-xs">
      <span class="whitespace-nowrap">Observação noturna</span> · <span
        class="whitespace-nowrap">A 1 hora de Lisboa</span>
    </p>
    <h1
      class="reveal max-w-4xl text-[clamp(2.75rem,8vw,6rem)] leading-[1.02] font-bold tracking-[-0.03em]"
      style="--reveal-delay: 0.1s"
    >
      O céu que já<br />não vês
    </h1>
    <p
      class="reveal mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-cream-50/80"
      style="--reveal-delay: 0.2s"
    >
      80% das pessoas já não consegue ver a Via Láctea de casa. Abro-te as
      portas do Universo com sessões de observação no meu observatório.
    </p>
    <div class="reveal mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-4" style="--reveal-delay: 0.3s">
      <a href="#calendario" class="btn btn-primary">Reservar sessão</a>
      <a href="#alojamentos" class="btn btn-ghost">Para alojamentos locais</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <a
    href="#sobre"
    class="absolute bottom-8 right-6 hidden flex-col items-center gap-3 text-cream-50/50 transition-colors hover:text-accent-200 sm:flex"
    aria-label="Continuar para a secção seguinte"
  >
    <span class="text-[0.65rem] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.22em] [writing-mode:vertical-rl]"
      >continua</span
    >
    <span class="block h-14 w-px overflow-hidden bg-cream-50/20">
      <span class="scroll-cue block h-1/2 w-full bg-accent-300"></span>
    </span>
  </a>
</section>

<style>
  @keyframes cue {
    0% {
      transform: translateY(-100%);
    }
    100% {
      transform: translateY(200%);
    }
  }
  .scroll-cue {
    animation: cue 2.2s cubic-bezier(0.45, 0, 0.55, 1) infinite;
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .scroll-cue {
      animation: none;
    }
  }
</style>
